# Overhead Budget Policy (P1)

**Status:** P1-candidate

## Budget
- Max 4 agents
- Max 2 spawn rounds
- Max 12 process artifacts per run

## Enforcement
- < 2x Vanilla overhead: no action
- 2-3x Vanilla overhead: WARN in report
- > 3x Vanilla overhead: BLOCK_CLOSURE

## Tracking
Required log: logs/process-overhead.jsonl
Metrics: agentSpawnCount, agentCloseCount, artifactCount, wallClockEstimate, humanInterventionCount
